		{
			"id": "DecisionDetail",
			"_note": "The decision page in the simple structure (openspec/changes/simple-decision-page). The full structure has no overlay, so its page is today's page. STAGE: `lifecycle`, the decision's own state. Each state has ONE primary button, the transition that leaves it, and the button posts to the same guarded endpoint the Lifecycle block uses (POST /api/decisions/{id}/transition). The server decides who may use it: a chair-only transition a member tries is refused there, and the refusal is shown. `enacted` leads to Publish, which posts to the publication endpoint the Publication block uses. NOTHING IS TAKEN AWAY: the Lifecycle block is the last entry under More, with every transition the server offers, the chair-only mark and the publish prompt of a body that asks for one. THE SIX BLOCKS THE MANIFEST DECLARES AS `custom` are named here by their registry component (`configPatch.widgets`), because a tab resolves a widget by type and a `custom` one only resolves through the page's slot map, which a tab does not read. THE STEP BAR is display only. QUICK ACTIONS: Archive and the discussion and integrations page. Archive is beside the primary button on a decided or enacted decision, so an enacted decision that is already public (where Publish no longer shows) still has a button for its next step and never a finished checklist with nothing to press. Adding a document or an action item stays inside its own block (Documents, More): the library has no header action that opens a block's own add dialog, and none is invented here.",
			"config": {
				"stageField": "lifecycle",
				"primaryActionByStage": {
					"draft": "decision-propose",
					"proposed": "decision-deliberate",
					"deliberating": "decision-open-voting",
					"voting": "decision-decide",
					"decided": "decision-enact",
					"enacted": "decision-publish"
				},
				"quickActions": [
					"decision-archive",
					"decision-open-integrations"
				],
				"actionsMenu": {
					"showRefresh": false,
					"label": "More"
				},
				"statusPill": {
					"field": "lifecycle",
					"labels": {
						"draft": "Draft",
						"proposed": "Proposed",
						"deliberating": "Deliberating",
						"voting": "Voting",
						"decided": "Decided",
						"enacted": "Enacted",
						"archived": "Archived",
						"withdrawn": "Withdrawn"
					},
					"colorMap": {
						"draft": "default",
						"proposed": "primary",
						"deliberating": "primary",
						"voting": "warning",
						"decided": "success",
						"enacted": "success",
						"archived": "default",
						"withdrawn": "default"
					}
				},
				"nextStep": {
					"stages": {
						"draft": {
							"title": "What now? Finish the proposal",
							"after": "Then: deliberation",
							"checklist": [
								{
									"label": "Write the text",
									"doneField": "text"
								},
								{
									"label": "Name the proposer",
									"doneField": "proposer"
								},
								{
									"label": "Give the legal basis",
									"doneField": "legalBasis"
								}
							]
						},
						"proposed": {
							"title": "What now? Bring it to a meeting",
							"after": "Then: the vote",
							"checklist": [
								{
									"label": "Choose the meeting",
									"doneField": "meeting"
								},
								{
									"label": "Link the agenda item",
									"doneField": "agendaItem"
								}
							]
						},
						"deliberating": {
							"title": "What now? Prepare the vote",
							"after": "Then: record the decision",
							"checklist": [
								{
									"label": "Choose how the vote is taken",
									"doneField": "voteType"
								},
								{
									"label": "Set the majority that is needed",
									"doneField": "voteThreshold"
								}
							]
						},
						"voting": {
							"title": "What now? Close the vote",
							"after": "Then: enact the decision",
							"checklist": [
								{
									"label": "Record the outcome",
									"doneField": "outcome"
								}
							]
						},
						"decided": {
							"title": "What now? Put the decision into effect",
							"after": "Then: publish",
							"checklist": [
								{
									"label": "Set the decision date",
									"doneField": "decisionDate"
								},
								{
									"label": "Set the date it takes effect",
									"doneField": "effectiveDate"
								}
							]
						},
						"enacted": {
							"title": "What now? Make it known",
							"checklist": [
								{
									"label": "Publish the decision",
									"doneWhen": {
										"field": "isPublished",
										"op": "eq",
										"value": "public"
									}
								},
								{
									"label": "Set the publication date",
									"doneField": "publicationDate"
								}
							]
						}
					}
				},
